{"id":"kryuchok","lemma":"крючок","pos":"noun","rank":4265,"glosses":["hook","fish-hook","crochet-needle"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b8/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D1%8E%D1%87%D0%BE%D0%BA.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%80%D1%8E%D1%87%D0%BE%D0%BA.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"крючка","plural":"крючки"},"examples":[{"text":"Дай мне рыболовный крючок.","en":"Give me a fishhook.","words":[{"g":"the more insistent form…"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,null]},{"text":"Повесь шляпу на крючок.","en":"Hang your hat on the hook.","words":[{"g":"to hang, to hang up","l":"повесить"},null,{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Он повесил пиджак на крючок.","en":"He hung his coat on a hook.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to hang, to hang up","l":"повесить"},{"g":"coat, jacket"},{"g":"on / at"},null]},{"text":"Том взял ключ с крючка, на котором тот висел.","en":"Tom took the key off of the hook it was hanging on.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to take","l":"взять"},{"g":"key"},{"g":"with / from"},null,{"g":"on / at"},null,{"g":"that one, those ones"},null]},{"text":"Я насадил на крючок наживку.","en":"I baited the hook.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"on / at"},null,null]}]}